  "claim_boundary": "The real Red target-choice and ACP candidate boundaries are implemented. Real ACP providers propose only replacement RTL and edit text; the runner derives semantic patch metadata from a bounded token-AST diff and binds it to verifier checks. Candidate-local AST/no-op materialization failures receive rejected signatures and do not abort the remaining planned slots. Injected-transport smoke tests close the runner-owned GRD formal triplet, ACP oracle selection, and invalid-candidate isolation. The checked-in pilot template remains non-executable. No third-party model result, GRD-8 yield, ACP-7 gain, multi-round result, or promotion evidence is claimed.",
